 10.33 8.55 8.38 8.20 7.20 6.99 5.01 (10.4%)\n*Prior score deciles can be uneven depending upon the prior score distribution","School level impact\n• We are currently in the process of finalizing school level impact\nanalyses and want to share some of the initial looks at these results.\n• To calculate impact at the school level we calculate for each school:\nUnadjusted Impact = Median SGP2019- Median SGP2021\n• We adjust for regression to the mean for this difference score by\nusing pre-pandemic (2017 to 2019) school level median SGP scores.\n• Results forthcoming shortly\n\nPandemic Related Academic Impact in Illinois 7"]
